{"time": "20261117T173151Z", "think": "Quest finished; give the notes.", "command": "answer 1. I now hold all three seal-stones. Never-Writes-Twice wants them brought to her before anyone approaches the Kings Gate. Rivals remain: the Unbound and Ennodius Vanin. 2. Bring the stones to Never-Writes-Twice in Nesh-Deeka House in Helstrom. 3. Bring them to her as ordered, or go straight to the Kings Gate under Teku-Sul Spire (dive from Bell Station); I do not see another choice yet. 4. I do not know who Never-Writes-Twice truly is or why she wants the stones first, nor why the Unbound drain trees, what moans in the Fort Chalkmoth cellar, or how Nesh-Deeka knows the Unbound. I can ask her and Nesh-Deeka.", "result": "Noted.\n\nThe quest is over. Write your notes: what you now know and have, as you would tell a friend picking up your save. Give them in one command: answer '...'", "summary": {"stage": 93, "at": "Vault of the Household", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-thief": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-vault": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-deep": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vos